OL,3,GNEWSATherapy centre closes after
OL,4,A'upsetting' floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA therapy centre for people with
OL,7,FMultiple Sclerosis (MS) in
OL,8,FWolverhampton says it will be closed
OL,9,Funtil further notice after being
OL,10,Fflooded.
OL,12,FThe Wolverhampton Multiple Sclerosis
OL,13,FTherapy Centre said the damage happened
OL,14,Fon 28 August, after storms caused flash
OL,15,Fflooding across the region.
OL,17,FThe site will remain shut while damage
OL,18,Fis assessed and discussions with
OL,19,Finsurers.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
