OL,3,GNEWSATherapy centre closes after
OL,4,A'upsetting' floods
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was incredibly upsetting for all of
OL,7,Fus to see the centre, which means so
OL,8,Fmuch to so many people, affected in
OL,9,Fthis way," said Paula Anderson, its
OL,10,Fmanager.
